        <mxCell id="c73" value="&lt;b&gt;Why closed-loop learning instead of fine-tuning&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#333333;&quot;&gt;auditable — every flag traces to a rule + evidence · reversible — rules and KB are versioned · cheap — no GPUs · reproducible — each analysis stores kb_version · rule_pack_version · baseline_snapshot · model · prompt_version&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
